  "content": "\n      <section id=\"shopify-section-template--21120678887592__about-hero\" class=\"shopify-section\">\n\n<section class=\"nn-ah\" id=\"nn-ah-template--21120678887592__about-hero\" style=\"\n    --nn-ah-height: 280px;\n    --nn-ah-overlay: #000000;\n    --nn-ah-overlay-opacity: 0.45;\n  \"><img class=\"nn-ah__bg\" src=\"/media/Banner2-BG.jpg_2_f91bb5.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"eager\" style=\"object-position: bottom center;\"><span class=\"nn-ah__overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <div class=\"nn-ah__content\"><span class=\"nn-ah__eyebrow\">Namo Narayana</span><h1 class=\"nn-ah__heading\">Pure Goodness, Just the Way Nature Intended</h1><p class=\"nn-ah__sub\">At Namo Narayana, we believe good health begins with pure food. That belief inspired us to bring back the kind of desi ghee our grandparents trusted, made with patience, tradition, and honesty.</p><div class=\"nn-ah__intro\"><p>In a world full of shortcuts, we chose the longer path — because we believe purity is always worth the effort.</p></div></div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n.nn-ah {\n  position: relative;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  min-height: var(--nn-ah-height, 420px);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #1a2e28;\n}\n.nn-ah__bg {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0;\n  width: 100%; height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n}\nvideo.nn-ah__bg { object-position: center; }\n.nn-ah__overlay {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0;\n  background: var(--nn-ah-overlay);\n  opacity: var(--nn-ah-overlay-opacity);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n.nn-ah__content {\n  position: relative; z-index: 1;\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 48px 24px;\n  max-width: 800px;\n}\n.nn-ah__eyebrow {\n  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\n  font-family: 'Figtree', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .16em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n.nn-ah__eyebrow::before, .nn-ah__eyebrow::after {\n  content: ''; width: 28px; height: 1.5px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.35); border-radius: 2px;\n}\n.nn-ah__heading {\n  font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;\n  font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #fff;\n  line-height: 1.12;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  margin: 0 0 16px;\n}\n.nn-ah__sub {\n  font-family: 'Figtree', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(15px, 1.8vw, 19px);\n  font-weight: 400;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,.8);\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n.nn-ah__intro {\n  font-family: 'Figtree', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(14px, 1.5vw, 16px);\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  margin-top: 20px;\n  max-width: 640px;\n  margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\n}\n.nn-ah__intro p { margin: 0 0 10px; }\n.nn-ah__intro p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .nn-ah { min-height: calc(var(--nn-ah-height, 420px) * 0.65); }\n  .nn-ah__content { padding: 32px 16px; }\n}\n</style>\n\n\n</section><section id=\"shopify-section-template--21120678887592__about-story\" class=\"shopify-section\">\n\n<section class=\"nn-as\" id=\"nn-as-template--21120678887592__about-story\"><div class=\"nn-as__row\" style=\"background: #ffffff;\">\n      <div class=\"nn-as__inner\"><div class=\"nn-as__media\">\n            <video autoplay=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsinline=\"\" style=\"border-radius: 12px;\"><source src=\"/media/e60e9e9216384286ad7445ea474c6420_c4aba8.m3u8\" type=\"application/x-mpegURL\"><source src=\"/media/e60e9e9216384286ad7445ea474c6420.HD-1080p-7.2Mbps-90130411_8ae09c.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>\n          </div><div class=\"nn-as__text\"><span class=\"nn-as__eyebrow\" style=\"color: #00584b;\">Our Heritage</span><h2 class=\"nn-as__heading\">Our Story</h2><div class=\"nn-as__body\"><p>For generations, ghee has been more than just food in Indian homes. It has been a part of our traditions, festivals, and everyday meals.</p><p>Over time, many products became commercial, losing the authentic taste and goodness that once made them special.</p><p>That's why Namo Narayana was created — to bring back real A2 Gir Cow Ghee made the traditional Bilona way, without compromising on quality or purity.</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div><div class=\"nn-as__row nn-as__row--flip\" style=\"background: #fbf7ef;\">\n      <div class=\"nn-as__inner\"><div class=\"nn-as__media\">\n            <video autoplay=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsinline=\"\" style=\"border-radius: 12px;\"><source src=\"/media/6833e2996ada44949fc45e2f9e31e885_f3ffb3.m3u8\" type=\"application/x-mpegURL\"><source src=\"/media/6833e2996ada44949fc45e2f9e31e885.HD-1080p-7.2Mbps-90001096_566344.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>\n          </div><div class=\"nn-as__text\"><span class=\"nn-as__eyebrow\" style=\"color: #00584b;\">Our Process</span><h2 class=\"nn-as__heading\">Made the Traditional Bilona Way</h2><div class=\"nn-as__body\"><p>Every jar of Namo Narayana Ghee starts with fresh A2 milk from indigenous Gir cows. The milk is naturally turned into curd, hand-churned using the traditional Bilona method, and slow-cooked to create rich, aromatic, golden ghee.</p><p>No shortcuts. No preservatives. No artificial additives. Just pure ghee, crafted with care.</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div><div class=\"nn-as__row\" style=\"background: #ffffff;\">\n      <div class=\"nn-as__inner\"><div class=\"nn-as__media\">\n            <video autoplay=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsinline=\"\" style=\"border-radius: 12px;\"><source src=\"/media/e4c552f4dca94ea5b1bc50e1e85bf5ea_c00d4c.m3u8\" type=\"application/x-mpegURL\"><source src=\"/media/e4c552f4dca94ea5b1bc50e1e85bf5ea.HD-1080p-7.2Mbps-90001099_18f73e.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>\n          </div><div class=\"nn-as__text\"><span class=\"nn-as__eyebrow\" style=\"color: #00584b;\">Our Source</span><h2 class=\"nn-as__heading\">Pure from the Source</h2><div class=\"nn-as__body\"><p>Our Gir cows are raised with care and allowed to graze naturally. We use only A2 milk, known for its traditional nutritional value and wholesome goodness.</p><p>Every batch is carefully tested to ensure it meets the highest standards of quality before it reaches your home.</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div><div class=\"nn-as__row nn-as__row--flip\" style=\"background: #fbf7ef;\">\n      <div class=\"nn-as__inner\"><div class=\"nn-as__media\">\n            <video autoplay=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsinline=\"\" style=\"border-radius: 12px;\"><source src=\"/media/a8f6b141f4234fad853747e8a7b3a14a_3ed1ee.m3u8\" type=\"application/x-mpegURL\"><source src=\"/media/a8f6b141f4234fad853747e8a7b3a14a.HD-1080p-7.2Mbps-90019745_79275c.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>\n          </div><div class=\"nn-as__text\"><span class=\"nn-as__eyebrow\" style=\"color: #00584b;\">Our Promise</span><h2 class=\"nn-as__heading\">More Than a Brand</h2><div class=\"nn-as__body\"><p>Namo Narayana is more than a ghee brand. It's our promise to bring honest, traditional food back to Indian kitchens.</p><p>Every product we make reflects one simple belief —</p><p><strong>If it isn't good enough for our own family, it isn't good enough for yours.</strong></p></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></section>\n\n<style>\n.nn-as__row { padding: 56px 24px; }\n.nn-as__inner {\n  max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 48px; align-items: center;\n}\n.nn-as__row--flip .nn-as__inner { direction: rtl; }\n.nn-as__row--flip .nn-as__inner > * { direction: ltr; }\n.nn-as__media img, .nn-as__media video { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; object-fit: cover; }\n.nn-as__eyebrow {\n  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\n  font-family: 'Figtree', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em;\n  text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.nn-as__eyebrow::before { content: ''; width: 24px; height: 2px; background: currentColor; border-radius: 2px; }\n.nn-as__heading {\n  font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;\n  font-size: clamp(24px, 3.2vw, 36px); font-weight: 600;\n  color: #1a2e28; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -.01em;\n  margin: 0 0 16px;\n}\n.nn-as__body {\n  font-family: 'Figtree', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #444;\n}\n.nn-as__body p { margin: 0 0 12px; }\n.nn-as__body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n.nn-as__btn {\n  display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px;\n  padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 8px;\n  font-family: 'Figtree', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff;\n  text-decoration: none; transition: opacity .2s;\n}\n.nn-as__btn:hover { opacity: .88; }\n@media (max-width: 750px) {\n  .nn-as__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }\n  .nn-as__row--flip .nn-as__inner { direction: ltr; }\n  .nn-as__row { padding: 36px 16px; }\n}\n</style>\n\n\n</section><section id=\"shopify-section-template--21120678887592__about-values\" class=\"shopify-section\">\n\n<section class=\"nn-av\" id=\"nn-av-template--21120678887592__about-values\" style=\"background: #ffffff;\">\n  <div class=\"nn-av__wrap\"><div class=\"nn-av__header\"><span class=\"nn-av__eyebrow\">Our Promise</span><h2 class=\"nn-av__heading\">What Sets Us Apart</h2></div><div class=\"nn-av__grid nn-av__grid--4\"><div class=\"nn-av__card\"><div class=\"nn-av__emoji\">🐄</div><h3 class=\"nn-av__title\">Pure A2 Gir Cow Milk</h3><p class=\"nn-av__desc\">Sourced from indigenous Gir cows, raised on natural pastures with love and care.</p></div><div class=\"nn-av__card\"><div class=\"nn-av__emoji\">🧈</div><h3 class=\"nn-av__title\">Traditional Bilona Method</h3><p class=\"nn-av__desc\">Hand-churned from curd and slow-cooked the ancient way to preserve every nutrient.</p></div><div class=\"nn-av__card\"><div class=\"nn-av__emoji\">🌿</div><h3 class=\"nn-av__title\">100% Natural</h3><p class=\"nn-av__desc\">No additives, no preservatives, no artificial flavours — just pure, honest goodness.</p></div><div class=\"nn-av__card\"><div class=\"nn-av__emoji\">🔬</div><h3 class=\"nn-av__title\">Lab Tested &amp; Certified</h3><p class=\"nn-av__desc\">Every batch is rigorously tested to ensure purity, quality, and safety.</p></div></div></div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n.nn-av { padding: 64px 24px; }\n.nn-av__wrap { max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.nn-av__header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 44px; }\n.nn-av__eyebrow {\n  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\n  font-family: 'Figtree', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .16em;\n  text-transform: uppercase; color: #00584B; margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n.nn-av__eyebrow::before, .nn-av__eyebrow::after {\n  content: ''; width: 24px; height: 1.5px; background: #00584B; opacity: .4; border-radius: 2px;\n}\n.nn-av__heading {\n  font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;\n  font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 38px); font-weight: 600;\n  color: #1a2e28; line-height: 1.18; margin: 0 0 12px;\n}\n.nn-av__sub {\n  font-family: 'Figtree', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 15px; color: #666; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.nn-av__grid {\n  display: grid; gap: 28px;\n}\n.nn-av__grid--3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }\n.nn-av__grid--4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }\n.nn-av__grid--2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n.nn-av__card {\n  text-align: center; padding: 32px 20px;\n  background: #fff; border-radius: 14px;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\n  transition: box-shadow .25s, transform .25s;\n}\n.nn-av__card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(0,88,75,.08); transform: translateY(-3px); }\n.nn-av__icon img { width: 56px; height: 56px; object-fit: contain; margin: 0 auto 16px; display: block; }\n.nn-av__emoji { font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 14px; line-height: 1; }\n.nn-av__title {\n  font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;\n  font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #1a2e28;\n  margin: 0 0 8px; line-height: 1.3;\n}\n.nn-av__desc {\n  font-family: 'Figtree', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 750px) {\n  .nn-av { padding: 40px 16px; }\n  .nn-av__grid--3, .nn-av__grid--4 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  .nn-av__card { padding: 24px 16px; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 450px) {\n  .nn-av__grid--2, .nn-av__grid--3, .nn-av__grid--4 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n</style>\n\n\n</section><section id=\"shopify-section-template--21120678887592__about-cta\" class=\"shopify-section\">\n\n<section class=\"nn-acta\" id=\"nn-acta-template--21120678887592__about-cta\" style=\"background: #00584b;\"><div class=\"nn-acta__content\"><h2 class=\"nn-acta__heading\" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Namo Narayana</h2><p class=\"nn-acta__sub\" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Pure by Promise. Traditional by Heart.</p><a href=\"\" class=\"nn-acta__btn\" style=\"background: #d4a853; color: #1a2e28;\">\n        Shop Now\n      </a></div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n.nn-acta {\n  position: relative; overflow: hidden;\n  padding: 64px 24px; text-align: center;\n}\n.nn-acta__bg {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0;\n  width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block;\n}\n.nn-acta__overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; }\n.nn-acta__content { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.nn-acta__heading {\n  font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;\n  font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px); font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.18; margin: 0 0 14px;\n}\n.nn-acta__sub {\n  font-family: 'Figtree', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; opacity: .85; margin: 0 0 28px;\n}\n.nn-acta__btn {\n  display: inline-block; padding: 14px 36px;\n  border-radius: 8px; font-family: 'Figtree', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;\n  transition: opacity .2s;\n}\n.nn-acta__btn:hover { opacity: .88; }\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .nn-acta { padding: 44px 16px; }\n}\n</style>\n\n\n</section>\n    "
